    "Your prior approval notification has been refused as prior approval extensions are restricted to C3 dwellinhouses and not flats.  Schedule 2, Part 1 does not apply to properties converted to flats or purpose-built flats and is only applicable to C3 dwellinghouses. Redbridge GIS records shows this property is converted to 2 flata, Nos 437 Ground Floor  & 437A 1st floor. The proposal, therefore, does not comply to permitted development rules and is found contrary to  Article 3, Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order 2015 (as amended)."
